      "text": "for(int i= 0 ; i+1 < nodes.size() ; i++){\n\nif(nodes[i]->val > nodes[i+1]){\n    if(a==NULL) {\n        a = nodes[i]\n        b = nodes[i+1]\n    }else{\n        b = nodes[i+1]\n    }\n}\n\n}",
